  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of RTPD&apos;s( Network for Research and Training in Parasitic Diseases at the Southern Cone of Latin America)network activities concentrating on Bolivia, Paraguay and Peru. The specific activities includes annual research courses, student exchange fellowships incl bench fee support, a triennial meeting, administration and the set up of a web page.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvidgning av RTPD&#xb4;s n&#xe4;tverksaktiviteter med fokus p&#xe5; Bolivia, Paraguay och Peru genom st&#xf6;d till &#xe5;rliga forskarutbildningskurser, stipendium f&#xf6;r studentutbyte inkl bench fee, triennial meeting, administration och byggande av hemsida.</narrative>
